      "writtenOn": "2022-11-25T06:29:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I find it a bit strange as an API to send both onServiceUpdated and onServiceResolved when the service is resolved; I would say onServiceUpdated should only be sent after the first complete/resolved event (which would also match current behavior). See suggestion below.",
      "revId": "92713c7935839f595792f30ff2e2e7b3156373c9",
