      "writtenOn": "2022-11-25T06:29:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry I suggested this originally, but actually this would cause onServiceResolved to be sent multiple times, every time there is an update of the service.\n\nProbably it should be:\n\n    if (newServiceFound)\n        onServiceFound\n\n    if (isComplete() \u0026\u0026 (previousResponse \u003d\u003d null || !previousResponse.isComplete()))\n        onServiceResolved\n    else if (previousResponse !\u003d null \u0026\u0026 previousResponse.isComplete())\n        onServiceUpdated",
      "revId": "92713c7935839f595792f30ff2e2e7b3156373c9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
